<linker>
  <!--
    Managed stripping is set to High for Android, which removes members no analysed call
    reaches. LevelDto and ChapterFile are auto-property DTOs whose setters are only ever
    invoked by Newtonsoft through reflection (ChapterLevelRepository reads chapter JSON at
    runtime), so the linker cannot see those calls and is free to drop them. A stripped
    build would then deserialise every level into default values and load nothing.

    The assembly is a dozen small classes, so preserving all of it costs almost nothing and
    survives someone adding a field to the DTO later.
  -->
  <assembly fullname="ASTeams.SingleLine.Data" preserve="all"/>
</linker>
